# Input

```md
| a | b |
| --- | --- |
| <!-- c --> | x |

| a | b |
| --: | --- |
| <!-- c --> | x |

| a | b |
| --- | --- |
| t <!-- c --> | x |

```


# Options

```json
{
  "markdown": {
    "parser": {
      "gfm": true
    }
  }
}
```

# Formatted

```md
| a          | b   |
| ---------- | --- |
| <!-- c --> | x   |

|          a | b   |
| ---------: | --- |
| <!-- c --> | x   |

| a            | b   |
| ------------ | --- |
| t <!-- c --> | x   |

```
